@startuml C4-Dynamic-Portfolio-Aggregate
!include style-zinc.puml

title Dynamic — Portfolio aggregate (Java → Python)

actor Investor as investor
participant "Portal / Mobile" as ui
participant "Java API\nproxy routes :8801" as java
participant "Python Analytics\nrouters/services :8800" as py
database "PostgreSQL" as db

investor -> ui: 1. Open portfolio view
ui -> java: 2. GET /api/v1/portfolio\n(Authorization: Bearer)
java -> py: 3. Proxy HTTP via PYTHON_BACKEND_URL
py -> db: 4. Read holdings / positions
db --> py: 5. Rows
py --> java: 6. Aggregated portfolio JSON
java --> ui: 7. 200 aggregate
ui --> investor: 8. Render portfolio

note right of java
  Java is the public entry (:8801);
  analytics composition stays on :8800.
end note

@enduml
